{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/ManualIntegration","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK by embedding XCFrameworks directly into your Xcode project.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you cannot use Swift Package Manager, you can integrate the SDK by manually embedding the pre-built XCFrameworks into your project. This guide covers which frameworks to include, how to configure your project, and what to import in your code.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Download the SDK","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Download-the-SDK"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Obtain the SDK distribution package from Adyen. The package contains the following structure:"}]},{"code":["Build-IssuingSDK\/","├── XCFrameworks\/","│   ├── NetworkTokenProvisioning.xcframework","│   ├── IssuingCore.xcframework","│   └── IssuingCommon.xcframework","└── Documentation\/"],"syntax":"text","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You also need the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning"},{"text":" SDK, available from ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-apple-pay-provisioning-ios"},{"text":". Download the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning.xcframework"},{"text":" (and ","type":"text"},{"code":"AdyenApplePayExtensionProvisioning.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if you use a Wallet Extension).","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Required-Frameworks","text":"Required Frameworks","type":"heading","level":2},{"text":"Network Token Provisioning","level":3,"anchor":"Network-Token-Provisioning","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All of the following fra